    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;Install the preview&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use standard CPython 3.10–3.14 in a virtual environment. These wheels include the native runtime; no Rust toolchain or source build is needed. This preview is distributed through GitHub Releases, not PyPI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run the command for your platform:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linux x86_64 (glibc 2.39 or newer)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
